# * check balanced
# ** 1. Check that prices balance without auto-inferring prices
<
2011/01/01 x
  a  -10£
  b  16$
$ hledger -f - check balanced
>2 /real postings' sum should be 0 but is 16\$, -10£/
>=1

# ** 2. This also works when an amount comes from a balance assignment.
<
2011/01/01 x
  a  -10£
  b  = 16$
$ hledger -f - check balanced
>2 /real postings' sum should be 0 but is 16\$, -10£/
>=1
